<!-- ══ TGS CONTENT ══ -->
<section class="cr-tgs-content">
  <div class="cr-tgs-inner">

    <!-- TGS Logo -->
    <div class="cr-tgs-logo fade-up">
      <img src="/images/college-recruiting/tgs-logo.png" alt="Total Global Sports" />
    </div>

    <!-- TGS Partnership Announcement -->
    <div class="cr-article fade-up">
      <h2>TGS Partnership Announcement</h2>
      <p>
        Albany Alleycats provides you with a college recruiting system that makes sense and makes
        the job of a college coach a whole lot easier too. We've partnered with Total Global Sports
        (TGS) to give you access to a complete and fully integrated platform to assist you in
        managing all of your recruiting efforts. Update and share your upcoming game schedule,
        research schools, connect with college coaches, share the game film, and follow a guided
        timeline to ensure you are on track to accomplish your collegiate goals. If you have
        additional questions, TGS provides an around-the-clock help desk to cater to your every need.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- What TGS Provides to Players -->
    <div class="cr-article fade-up">
      <h2>What TGS Provides to Players</h2>
      <p>
        TGS Player Profiles are automatically linked with a player's teams, clubs, leagues, and
        events. No need to add individual league games or team information, as it is already
        included in the profile and updated live in real time. This makes it much easier for
        college coaches to find players and view their games. Knowing that players are always on
        the go, TGS has developed a mobile app that gives players full access to their profiles
        from anywhere. Update your profile, favorite a new college, and send your game schedule
        to college coaches — all from the palm of your hand. Download it here.
      </p>

      <div class="cr-profile-img">
        <img src="/images/college-recruiting/tgs-player-profile.png" alt="TGS Player Profile App" loading="lazy" />
      </div>

      <p>
        The Player Profile is already connected with thousands of college coaches from across
        the country. College coaches have full access to your profile at any time through their
        own TGS recruiting app, which directly links them to your profile and schedule. TGS has
        made communicating with colleges simple and efficient. With custom email templates,
        players do not need to worry about attaching personal information or profile links
        manually. The platform offers one-touch emails that allow players to quickly invite
        college coaches to upcoming matches. Using a custom algorithm, TGS also matches players
        with potential colleges based on preferences such as location, school size, division, and
        other important factors. Players can access detailed college information, including staff
        contacts, admission requirements, costs, and more. Through the search functions, players
        can explore colleges that match their goals and learn more about each program. From
        freshman year through senior year, the TGS Player Profile account provides a
        comprehensive checklist to help players stay organized and on track throughout the
        recruiting process.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Player Profile Assistance -->
    <div class="cr-article fade-up">
      <h2>Player Profile Assistance</h2>
      <p>TGS offers lots of support to players and their families:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Watch A Video Overview of The Player Profile</li>
        <li>Download the Player app</li>
        <li>Help Guides</li>
        <li>Submit a Support Ticket</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Player Webinars -->
    <div class="cr-article fade-up">
      <h2>Player Webinars</h2>
      <p>
        Webinars are designed for individual players and their families, and we encourage parents
        to attend alongside the player. Each webinar is customized for a specific age group and
        may include guest speakers. The sessions cover a wide range of topics, with new webinars
        continually being added. Be sure to register early, as space is limited.
        See the upcoming webinars.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- TGS CAP Program -->
    <div class="cr-article fade-up">
      <h2>TGS CAP Program</h2>
      <p>
        Whether you are just starting the recruiting process, already in the middle of it, or
        trying to finalize the right fit, our staff can help guide you through every step of the
        journey. We provide expert, personalized advice to help you make the best decisions for
        your future. Each year, there are over 12,000 athletic and academic college scholarships
        available, along with financial aid packages and grants for qualified students. Through
        the TGS College Advisor Program (CAP), we educate players and families about the
        resources and opportunities available to them. Our goal is to provide the expert guidance
        and individualized support needed for a successful recruiting experience. The TGS College
        Advisor Program streamlines the entire process and pairs you with a dedicated College
        Advisor who works closely with you and your family every step of the way. Schedule a call
        to learn more about this unique program.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
